<title>ITALY: Stet board confirms appointment of new MD.</title>
<headline>Stet board confirms appointment of new MD.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of state telecom group Stet said on Thursday it had approved the appointment of Guido Rossi as chairman and Tomaso Tommasi di Vignano as managing director of the group.</p>
<p>Rossi, a Milan-based lawyer, takes over from Biagio Agnes while Tommasi di Vignano replaces Ernesto Pascale.</p>
<p>Both Agnes and Pascale had tendered their resignations.</p>
<p>(( Milan newsroom +392-66102321 ))</p>
